{"id": "97110005", "name": "הגדרת הגבול (ε–δ) – δ הגדול ביותר לפונקציה לינארית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נתון הגבול</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:0}},\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to {{CT:1}}}f(x)={{CT:2}} \\]</p><p>לפי הגדרת הגבול, לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\varepsilon>0\\)</span> קיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\delta>0\\)</span> כך שלכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> המקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt|x-x_0|\\lt\\delta\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|f(x)-L|\\lt\\varepsilon\\)</span>.</p><p>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\varepsilon={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, מצאו את ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> <b>הגדול ביותר</b> כך שלכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> המקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt|{{CT:4}}|\\lt\\delta\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left|{{CT:0}}-\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\right|\\lt{{CT:3}}\\)</span>. רשמו שבר מדויק.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\delta=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מפשטים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|f(x)-L|\\)</span> לכפולה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|x-x_0|\\)</span>, ומחלצים ממנה תנאי על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|x-x_0|\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פישוט</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ |f(x)-L|=\\left|{{CT:0}}-\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)\\right|=\\left|{{CT:5}}\\right|=\\left|{{CT:6}}\\right|\\cdot|{{CT:4}}|={{CT:7}}\\,|{{CT:4}}| \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התנאי על x</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:7}}\\,|{{CT:4}}|\\lt{{CT:3}}\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad |{{CT:4}}|\\lt\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:7}} }={{CT:8}} \\]</p>לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\delta={{CT:8}}\\)</span> מתאים: כל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> המקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt|{{CT:4}}|\\lt{{CT:8}}\\)</span> מקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|f(x)-L|\\lt\\varepsilon\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — למה זה ה-δ הגדול ביותר</b><br>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\delta>{{CT:8}}\\)</span>, הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=x_0+{{CT:8}}={{CT:9}}\\)</span> מקיימת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt|{{CT:4}}|\\lt\\delta\\)</span>, אבל עבורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|f(x)-L|={{CT:7}}\\cdot {{CT:8}}={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, ולא קטן מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>. לכן:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\delta={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "eps*am", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>כפלתם ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span> במקום לחלק. מהתנאי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\,|{{CT:4}}|\\lt\\varepsilon\\)</span> צריך לבודד את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|{{CT:4}}|\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "eps", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>שימו לב למקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|f(x)-L|={{CT:7}}\\,|{{CT:4}}|\\)</span>, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|{{CT:4}}|\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["L", "am", "bb", "eps", "mm", "ta", "x0"], "nvariants": 50}